DESCRIPTION:
    The scripts contained within this project are to demonstrate the use of MongoDB Atlas Data Federation and Atlas Search for 
    demonstration purposes (only). The show the difference between $merge & bulk write operations on a target data set using contained
    intended to be run from inside an Atlas Trigger (or other hosted serverless function) as well as queries that can be run either 
    within Mongo Shell (mongosh) or in MongoDB Compass against the target database